# Text is stored with LF; everything below is binary and never touched, or a
# checkout on Windows would turn the sample PDFs' line ends into CRLF and break them.
* text=auto
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.docx binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.onnx binary
